s\' !important;\\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\\n    color: #18505a;\\n    line-height: 1;\\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\\n}\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"b84daf4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>1. Comprehensive evaluation \\u2014 understanding your symptoms, triggers, and history<br \\/>2. Personalized treatment plan \\u2014 designed to reduce anxiety and restore balance<br \\/>3. Ongoing follow-up \\u2014 regular check-ins, adjustments as needed, and an open line of communication<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Jost\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#666666\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f4bd4c7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Take the Next Step\\n\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Tenor Sans\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":45,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"title_color\":\"#18505A\",\"custom_css\":\"selector{\\n        font-family: \'Tenor Sans\' !important;\\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\\n    color: #18505a;\\n    line-height: 1;\\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\\n}\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"57003fa\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>If you\\u2019ve been searching for professional anxiety treatment or a psychiatrist for anxiety, Zellig is here to help. Schedule your consultation today and take the first step toward lasting relief.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Jost\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#666666\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
