(19, 1, '2026-02-04 07:24:25', '2026-02-04 07:24:25', '<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1538\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-300x180.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-1024x615.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-768x462.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-1536x923.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-2048x1231.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>Understanding Anxiety</h3>		<p>Anxiety is more than occasional worry. When it becomes constant, overwhelming, or disruptive, it can feel impossible to find peace of mind. If you’re living with anxiety, you’re not alone—and with the right care, relief is possible.</p>			<h3>What Anxiety Feels Like\n</h3>		<p>People experiencing anxiety often describe:</p><ul><li><p>Restlessness or feeling “on edge”</p></li><li><p>Racing thoughts or difficulty controlling worry</p></li><li><p>Physical symptoms like rapid heartbeat, sweating, or stomach upset</p></li><li><p>Difficulty sleeping or relaxing</p></li><li><p>Trouble focusing at work or in daily life</p></li></ul><p><br />Anxiety shows up differently for everyone, but its impact is always real.</p>			<h3>Why Treatment Matters\n</h3>		<p>Unchecked anxiety can affect your health, your relationships, and your ability to enjoy life. The good news: anxiety is treatable. With the right support, you can learn to calm your mind, manage stress, and move through life with greater confidence</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>At Zellig, we offer thoughtful, evidence-based psychiatric care for anxiety, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> when appropriate, tailored to your unique needs</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative treatment</strong> <strong>planning</strong> that respects your goals and lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive resources and referrals </strong>to strengthen coping skills and long-term resilience</p></li></ul><p><br />Our focus is on helping you feel in control again, with care that is both compassionate and clinically precise.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-300x225.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-768x576.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																										<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>What to Expect at Zellig\n</h3>		<p>1. Comprehensive evaluation — understanding your symptoms, triggers, and history<br />2. Personalized treatment plan — designed to reduce anxiety and restore balance<br />3. Ongoing follow-up — regular check-ins, adjustments as needed, and an open line of communication</p>			<h3>Take the Next Step\n</h3>		<p>If you’ve been searching for professional anxiety treatment or a psychiatrist for anxiety, Zellig is here to help. Schedule your consultation today and take the first step toward lasting relief.</p>', 'Anxiety', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'anxiety', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:23:59', '2026-02-04 14:23:59', '', 0, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/anxiety/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(20, 1, '2026-02-04 07:24:25', '2026-02-04 07:24:25', '<img width=\"1410\" height=\"940\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_003.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_003.png 1410w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_003-300x200.png 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_003-1024x683.png 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_003-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1410px) 100vw, 1410px\" />																<h3>Understanding ADHD\n</h3>		<p>Attention-Deficit/Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD) isn’t just about being distracted. It can affect focus, organization, relationships, and self-esteem at any age. Whether diagnosed in childhood or adulthood, ADHD is real—and with the right support, it can be managed effectively.</p>			<h3>What ADHD Feels Like\n</h3>		<p>People with ADHD often describe:</p><ul><li>Trouble focusing or completing tasks</li><li>Forgetfulness, disorganization, or losing track of time</li><li>Restlessness, fidgeting, or difficulty sitting still</li><li>Impulsivity or acting without thinking</li><li>Feeling frustrated or overwhelmed in work, school, or relationships</li></ul><p>ADHD looks different in every person, but its impact is always significant.</p>			<h3>Why Treatment Matters\n</h3>		<p>Without treatment, ADHD can cause stress, underachievement, and strain on daily life. With proper care, people often discover new levels of focus, productivity, and confidence.</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>We provide psychiatric treatment for ADHD, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> — stimulants and non-stimulant options tailored to you</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative care</strong> — addressing coexisting conditions like anxiety or depression</p></li><li><p><strong>Practical support</strong> — helping you build strategies for focus and balance</p></li></ul>													<img width=\"1283\" height=\"1604\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002.png 1283w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-240x300.png 240w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-819x1024.png 819w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-768x960.png 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-1229x1536.png 1229w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1283px) 100vw, 1283px\" />																										<img width=\"1324\" height=\"883\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001.png 1324w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001-300x200.png 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001-1024x683.png 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1324px) 100vw, 1324px\" />																<h3>What to Expect at Zellig\n</h3>		<ul><li><p><strong>Comprehensive evaluation</strong> — reviewing your history, symptoms, and goals</p></li><li><p><strong>Personalized treatment plan</strong> — medication and strategies to fit your lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Ongoing support</strong> — regular check-ins to fine-tune your care</p></li></ul>			<h3>Take the Next Step\n</h3>		<p>If you’re searching for professional ADHD treatment or a psychiatrist for ADHD, Zellig can help. Schedule a consultation today and take the first step toward greater focus and balance</p>', 'ADHD', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'adhd', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:52:54', '2026-02-04 14:52:54', '', 0, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/adhd/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(21, 1, '2026-02-04 07:24:25', '2026-02-04 07:24:25', '<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1709\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-768x513.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-2048x1367.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>Understanding Bipolar Disorder\n</h3>		<p>Bipolar disorder is more than mood swings. It involves cycles of depression and elevated mood states that can disrupt relationships, work, and overall stability. Living with bipolar disorder can feel unpredictable, but with the right treatment, balance is possible.</p>			<h3>What Bipolar Disorder Feels Like\n</h3>		<p>People with bipolar disorder often describe:</p><ul><li><p>Depressive episodes: sadness, loss of interest, low energy, feelings of hopelessness</p></li><li><p>Manic or hypomanic episodes: racing thoughts, reduced need for sleep, increased energy, impulsive decisions, or feeling unusually confident</p></li><li><p>Difficulty maintaining consistency at work or in relationships</p></li><li><p>Stress from not knowing when mood changes may happen next</p></li></ul><p>The condition can feel overwhelming, but effective, long-term management is within reach.</p>			<h3>Why Treatment Matters\n</h3>		<p>Without treatment, bipolar disorder can cause repeated disruptions to daily life, health, and stability. But with careful management, many people achieve steady mood, strong relationships, and greater confidence in their future.</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>At Zellig, we provide comprehensive psychiatric care for bipolar disorder, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> — mood stabilizers, antipsychotics, or other options tailored to each phase of illness</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative care planning</strong> — ongoing adjustments to find what works best for you</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive guidance</strong> — helping you recognize patterns, prevent relapses, and maintain balance over time</p></li></ul><p>Our care is thoughtful, personalized, and designed to support long-term stability.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																										<img width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-scaled.jpg 1707w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-200x300.jpg 200w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-683x1024.jpg 683w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-768x1152.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-1365x2048.jpg 1365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1707px) 100vw, 1707px\" />																<h3>What to Expect at Zellig\n</h3>		1. Thorough evaluation — reviewing your history, experiences, and goals\n2. Individualized treatment plan — focused on reducing symptoms and preventing future episodes\n3. Ongoing follow-up — regular check-ins, adjustments as needed, and proactive support for life’s changes			<h3>Take the Next Step</h3>		<p>If you’re looking for effective bipolar disorder treatment with a psychiatrist who understands the condition, Zellig is here for you. Reach out today to schedule a consultation and begin building stability.<br /><br />Here’s the Insomnia and OCD pages in the same consistent, SEO-optimized style.</p>', 'Bipolar', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bipolar', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:23:21', '2026-02-04 14:23:21', '', 0, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/bipolar/', 0, 'page', '', 0),
