(236, 1, '2026-02-04 14:05:01', '2026-02-04 14:05:01', '<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1538\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-300x180.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-1024x615.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-768x462.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-1536x923.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_003-2048x1231.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>Understanding Anxiety</h3>		<p>Anxiety is more than occasional worry. When it becomes constant, overwhelming, or disruptive, it can feel impossible to find peace of mind. If you’re living with anxiety, you’re not alone—and with the right care, relief is possible.</p>			<h3>What Anxiety Feels Like\n</h3>		<p>People experiencing anxiety often describe:</p><ul><li><p>Restlessness or feeling “on edge”</p></li><li><p>Racing thoughts or difficulty controlling worry</p></li><li><p>Physical symptoms like rapid heartbeat, sweating, or stomach upset</p></li><li><p>Difficulty sleeping or relaxing</p></li><li><p>Trouble focusing at work or in daily life</p></li></ul><p><br />Anxiety shows up differently for everyone, but its impact is always real.</p>			<h3>Why Treatment Matters\n</h3>		<p>Unchecked anxiety can affect your health, your relationships, and your ability to enjoy life. The good news: anxiety is treatable. With the right support, you can learn to calm your mind, manage stress, and move through life with greater confidence</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>At Zellig, we offer thoughtful, evidence-based psychiatric care for anxiety, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> when appropriate, tailored to your unique needs</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative treatment</strong> <strong>planning</strong> that respects your goals and lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive resources and referrals </strong>to strengthen coping skills and long-term resilience</p></li></ul><p><br />Our focus is on helping you feel in control again, with care that is both compassionate and clinically precise.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-300x225.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-768x576.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />', 'Anxiety', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '19-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:05:01', '2026-02-04 14:05:01', '', 19, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/?p=236', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
