ou</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative care</strong> — addressing coexisting conditions like anxiety or depression</p></li><li><p><strong>Practical support</strong> — helping you build strategies for focus and balance</p></li></ul>													<img width=\"1283\" height=\"1604\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002.png 1283w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-240x300.png 240w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-819x1024.png 819w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-768x960.png 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_002-1229x1536.png 1229w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1283px) 100vw, 1283px\" />																										<img width=\"1324\" height=\"883\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001.png 1324w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001-300x200.png 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001-1024x683.png 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ADHD_001-768x512.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1324px) 100vw, 1324px\" />																<h3>What to Expect at Zellig\n</h3>		<ul><li><p><strong>Comprehensive evaluation</strong> — reviewing your history, symptoms, and goals</p></li><li><p><strong>Personalized treatment plan</strong> — medication and strategies to fit your lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Ongoing support</strong> — regular check-ins to fine-tune your care</p></li></ul>			<h3>Take the Next Step\n</h3>		<p>If you’re searching for professional ADHD treatment or a psychiatrist for ADHD, Zellig can help. Schedule a consultation today and take the first step toward greater focus and balance</p>', 'ADHD', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '20-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:13:43', '2026-02-04 14:13:43', '', 20, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/?p=251', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
