(256, 1, '2026-02-04 14:18:41', '2026-02-04 14:18:41', '<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1709\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-768x513.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-2048x1367.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>Understanding Bipolar Disorder\n</h3>		<p>Bipolar disorder is more than mood swings. It involves cycles of depression and elevated mood states that can disrupt relationships, work, and overall stability. Living with bipolar disorder can feel unpredictable, but with the right treatment, balance is possible.</p>			<h3>What Bipolar Disorder Feels Like\n</h3>		<p>People with bipolar disorder often describe:</p><ul><li><p>Depressive episodes: sadness, loss of interest, low energy, feelings of hopelessness</p></li><li><p>Manic or hypomanic episodes: racing thoughts, reduced need for sleep, increased energy, impulsive decisions, or feeling unusually confident</p></li><li><p>Difficulty maintaining consistency at work or in relationships</p></li><li><p>Stress from not knowing when mood changes may happen next</p></li></ul><p>The condition can feel overwhelming, but effective, long-term management is within reach.</p>			<h3>Why Treatment Matters\n</h3>		<p>Unchecked anxiety can affect your health, your relationships, and your ability to enjoy life. The good news: anxiety is treatable. With the right support, you can learn to calm your mind, manage stress, and move through life with greater confidence</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>At Zellig, we offer thoughtful, evidence-based psychiatric care for anxiety, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> when appropriate, tailored to your unique needs</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative treatment</strong> <strong>planning</strong> that respects your goals and lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive resources and referrals </strong>to strengthen coping skills and long-term resilience</p></li></ul><p><br />Our focus is on helping you feel in control again, with care that is both compassionate and clinically precise.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-300x225.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-768x576.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																										<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>What to Expect at Zellig\n</h3>		<p>1. Comprehensive evaluation — understanding your symptoms, triggers, and history<br />2. Personalized treatment plan — designed to reduce anxiety and restore balance<br />3. Ongoing follow-up — regular check-ins, adjustments as needed, and an open line of communication</p>			<h3>Take the Next Step\n</h3>		<p>If you’ve been searching for professional anxiety treatment or a psychiatrist for anxiety, Zellig is here to help. Schedule your consultation today and take the first step toward lasting relief.</p>', 'Bipolar', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '21-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:18:41', '2026-02-04 14:18:41', '', 21, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/?p=256', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
