e with greater confidence</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>At Zellig, we offer thoughtful, evidence-based psychiatric care for anxiety, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> when appropriate, tailored to your unique needs</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative treatment</strong> <strong>planning</strong> that respects your goals and lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive resources and referrals </strong>to strengthen coping skills and long-term resilience</p></li></ul><p><br />Our focus is on helping you feel in control again, with care that is both compassionate and clinically precise.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-300x225.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-768x576.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																										<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1536x1024.j