(266, 1, '2026-02-04 14:23:21', '2026-02-04 14:23:21', '<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1709\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-768x513.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_002-2048x1367.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>Understanding Bipolar Disorder\n</h3>		<p>Bipolar disorder is more than mood swings. It involves cycles of depression and elevated mood states that can disrupt relationships, work, and overall stability. Living with bipolar disorder can feel unpredictable, but with the right treatment, balance is possible.</p>			<h3>What Bipolar Disorder Feels Like\n</h3>		<p>People with bipolar disorder often describe:</p><ul><li><p>Depressive episodes: sadness, loss of interest, low energy, feelings of hopelessness</p></li><li><p>Manic or hypomanic episodes: racing thoughts, reduced need for sleep, increased energy, impulsive decisions, or feeling unusually confident</p></li><li><p>Difficulty maintaining consistency at work or in relationships</p></li><li><p>Stress from not knowing when mood changes may happen next</p></li></ul><p>The condition can feel overwhelming, but effective, long-term management is within reach.</p>			<h3>Why Treatment Matters\n</h3>		<p>Without treatment, bipolar disorder can cause repeated disruptions to daily life, health, and stability. But with careful management, many people achieve steady mood, strong relationships, and greater confidence in their future.</p>			<h3>How Zellig Helps\n</h3>		<p>At Zellig, we provide comprehensive psychiatric care for bipolar disorder, including:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Medication management</strong> — mood stabilizers, antipsychotics, or other options tailored to each phase of illness</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative care planning</strong> — ongoing adjustments to find what works best for you</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive guidance</strong> — helping you recognize patterns, prevent relapses, and maintain balance over time</p></li></ul><p>Our care is thoughtful, personalized, and designed to support long-term stability.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_003-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																										<img width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-scaled.jpg 1707w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-200x300.jpg 200w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-683x1024.jpg 683w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-768x1152.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/bipolar_001-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, 