>Medication management</strong> when appropriate, tailored to your unique needs</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative treatment</strong> <strong>planning</strong> that respects your goals and lifestyle</p></li><li><p><strong>Supportive resources and referrals </strong>to strengthen coping skills and long-term resilience</p></li></ul><p><br />Our focus is on helping you feel in control again, with care that is both compassionate and clinically precise.</p>													<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1920\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-300x225.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1024x768.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-768x576.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_001-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																										<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-scaled.jpg 2560w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/anxiety_004-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />																<h3>What to Expect at Zellig\n</h3>		<p>1. Comprehensive evaluation — understanding your symptoms, triggers, and history<br />2. Personalized treatment plan — designed to reduce anxiety and restore balance<br />3. Ongoing follow-up — regular check-ins, adjustments as needed, and an open line of communication</p>			<h3>Take the Next Step\n</h3>		<p>If you’ve been searching for professional anxiety treatment or a psychiatrist for anxiety, Zellig is here to help. Schedule your consultation today and take the first step toward lasting relief.</p>', 'Anxiety', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '19-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-02-04 14:23:59', '2026-02-04 14:23:59', '', 19, 'http://localhost/zeliigcaretheme/?p=270', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
